WEBVTT

00:03.380 --> 00:03.890
Hey.

00:04.230 --> 00:06.310
Oh, Vice Captain Daim.

00:06.680 --> 00:08.090
It's good to see you again.

00:08.090 --> 00:09.150
It has been a while.

00:09.370 --> 00:13.610
Prime Minister Magna advised me to
leave some monster materials here.

00:13.610 --> 00:16.120
Yes, I've been informed.

00:16.120 --> 00:17.350
Let's see...

00:17.350 --> 00:18.740
A place for you to put your materials...

00:19.810 --> 00:21.540
This should do for now.

00:21.540 --> 00:24.320
Um, I'm very sorry,

00:24.320 --> 00:27.000
but this room won't be big enough.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.560
What?! You have that many?

00:29.560 --> 00:33.550
Are they all like the red dragon
you have in your mansion?!

00:33.820 --> 00:36.910
Oh, no, there's nothing
quite that impressive.

00:36.910 --> 00:38.010
Just an earth dragon.

00:38.320 --> 00:41.240
An e-earth dragon?!

00:41.240 --> 00:46.390
The one a whole party of A-rank
adventurers can barely take down?

00:46.390 --> 00:47.980
That earth dragon?!

00:48.200 --> 00:51.730
I don't know much about it...
but it's a big one!

00:51.730 --> 00:53.220
Well, in that case...

00:53.580 --> 00:55.680
Could you leave it here for now?

00:55.680 --> 00:57.880
The knights will carry
it somewhere else later.

00:57.880 --> 00:59.180
All right.

00:59.180 --> 01:00.330
Here it comes.

01:09.000 --> 01:11.170
What <i>is</i> all this?!

01:11.170 --> 01:12.650
This is all of them.

01:12.650 --> 01:15.550
C-Cain... You are simply...

01:15.990 --> 01:17.010
Sorry, but...

01:17.370 --> 01:20.930
could you take all of these for me?

01:23.980 --> 01:27.310
<i>But the truth is... I have more
than just A-rank monsters.</i>

01:27.310 --> 01:29.420
<i>I have S-rank ones, too.</i>

01:29.420 --> 01:32.530
<i>That's because my status is off the charts...</i>

01:33.980 --> 01:37.370
<i>But that's a secret to everyone!</i>

01:48.170 --> 01:51.040
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

03:08.970 --> 03:13.310
"A Date with the Strongest Captain of the Knights"

03:08.970 --> 03:13.310
"A Date with the Strongest Captain of the Knights"

03:09.650 --> 03:11.460
U-Unbelievable...

03:11.460 --> 03:14.930
You're telling me you killed
all of these by yourself?

03:15.610 --> 03:16.420
Cain...

03:18.090 --> 03:19.590
Are you a hero?

03:19.800 --> 03:21.610
Or perhaps a disciple of the gods?

03:24.540 --> 03:28.810
No, no! I'm just the son of Margrave Garm!

03:28.810 --> 03:32.720
Hmm... Well, I suppose 
I won't probe too deeply.

03:32.720 --> 03:34.310
I'd appreciate that.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.140
Very well.

03:35.140 --> 03:39.420
It'll take a bit of time to appraise
this many. Is that all right?

03:39.420 --> 03:43.160
Sure. Just let me know when it's
done and I'll come right over.

03:43.160 --> 03:44.370
Well, then...

03:44.370 --> 03:45.120
Whoa, there.

03:45.530 --> 03:47.260
It's still early.

03:47.640 --> 03:50.250
Mind helping out with the knights' training?

03:50.680 --> 03:52.850
I'd like you to meet our captain, too.

03:53.210 --> 03:54.810
C-Captain?

03:54.810 --> 03:57.950
Yeah. Our captain loves strong folks.

03:57.950 --> 04:01.860
I'd love to show off what you can do. Okay?

04:02.490 --> 04:03.430
Okay?

04:07.170 --> 04:08.100
Okay.

04:08.940 --> 04:09.810
<i>And then...</i>

04:12.360 --> 04:15.010
Wait a minute!

04:14.710 --> 04:16.020
<b>Let's Go Back in Time</b>

04:16.340 --> 04:18.110
This is the hero, Baron Cain.

04:18.380 --> 04:20.190
As I'm sure you all know,

04:20.190 --> 04:26.060
this is the Baron Cain who annihilated
thirty orcs and saved the princess.

04:26.060 --> 04:27.780
Pleased to meet you all.

04:28.100 --> 04:30.010
Um, where's the captain?

04:30.010 --> 04:31.490
The captain will be here soon.

04:31.490 --> 04:35.370
As soon as the mock battle begins, I'll bet.

04:35.730 --> 04:37.880
Our captain does love a
good battle, after all.

04:37.880 --> 04:41.920
Oh, no! It's gonna be someone
super scary, isn't it?!

04:43.230 --> 04:46.340
Don't worry. The captain's not
gonna eat you or anything...

04:46.340 --> 04:47.240
Probably.

04:47.240 --> 04:47.760
What?

04:48.040 --> 04:51.180
All right, let the mock battle begin!

04:51.180 --> 04:54.020
U-Um... May I?

04:54.450 --> 04:56.850
He genuinely looks like a child.

04:56.850 --> 04:58.780
And he's only ten, right?

04:58.780 --> 05:01.480
Should the Royal Chivalric
Order really fight him?

05:01.710 --> 05:04.450
If you're worried, you can go first.

05:06.650 --> 05:07.610
Cain,

05:08.110 --> 05:10.190
I will grant you the first move.

05:10.780 --> 05:12.290
Come at me with what you've got.

05:12.520 --> 05:15.530
Very well! In that case... Boost!

05:23.420 --> 05:24.780
I am defeated.

05:25.310 --> 05:27.590
<i>I won! Crap!</i>

05:27.590 --> 05:29.220
Thank you very much...

05:29.220 --> 05:30.050
Wait, Cain!

05:30.920 --> 05:32.810
That was even better than I expected.

05:33.130 --> 05:37.330
Why don't you take on thirty...
no, all of them next?

05:37.330 --> 05:38.730
<b>Back to the Present</b>

05:39.660 --> 05:40.740
<i>And now...</i>

05:42.140 --> 05:43.780
Hold it!

05:44.740 --> 05:46.450
Hold it, hold it, hold it!

05:46.950 --> 05:51.910
What is going on here?!

05:53.560 --> 05:57.270
Why is an entire order of knights
pointing their swords at a child?

05:57.270 --> 05:59.750
Have you no pride as royal knights?!

06:02.090 --> 06:03.690
Are you okay?

06:03.690 --> 06:07.130
You must have been so frightened
with all these scary people around you.

06:07.130 --> 06:09.760
But I'm here now, so you'll be just fine.

06:09.760 --> 06:12.140
You must be a lost child
who wandered in here.

06:12.140 --> 06:13.930
<i>Ooh! An elf!</i>

06:13.930 --> 06:16.770
Daim! You were here with him!

06:16.770 --> 06:18.370
Why didn't you stop them?

06:18.370 --> 06:20.590
If I may, Captain...

06:20.590 --> 06:21.480
Captain?!

06:21.860 --> 06:27.570
This is the boy who annihilated thirty
orcs and saved Princess Telestia...

06:27.920 --> 06:30.280
The hero, Baron Cain.

06:30.280 --> 06:32.540
What? This child did that?

06:34.010 --> 06:35.610
I see...

06:36.650 --> 06:38.660
I see!

06:39.550 --> 06:45.370
So you are the one who
annihilated thirty orcs...

06:46.050 --> 06:49.200
The hero, Baron Cain!

06:49.200 --> 06:52.170
In that case, you must fight a duel with me!

06:50.650 --> 06:52.050
<b>Mock Battle</b>

06:52.170 --> 06:56.360
Wait, I'm sure I just heard "duel"
instead of "mock battle"...

06:56.360 --> 06:59.020
Captain, perhaps you should
introduce yourself first?

06:59.020 --> 07:02.020
No! We who fight with the sword 
speak with the sword!

07:02.260 --> 07:05.250
Oh, boy. There's the
captain's bad habit again.

07:05.250 --> 07:07.660
She does hold the title
of Master Swordsperson.

07:07.660 --> 07:09.860
I doubt even Baron Cain can handle her.

07:09.860 --> 07:14.070
Um, I can hear you. What's this
"Master Swordsperson" thing?

07:14.070 --> 07:15.900
Baron Cain, let us duel!

07:15.900 --> 07:20.480
W-Wait a second! The only weapon
I have is a wooden sword!

07:20.480 --> 07:22.580
Not a problem! I've dulled my blade!

07:27.250 --> 07:29.630
Looks like I'll be able
to fully enjoy this now!

07:29.630 --> 07:30.470
Boost!

07:37.140 --> 07:41.420
Wow... Baron Cain is giving the
captain a run for her money.

07:41.420 --> 07:43.720
And he's moving even faster than before.

07:43.720 --> 07:44.980
Unbelievable.

07:52.740 --> 07:54.150
Clock Up!

08:02.600 --> 08:04.420
This duel is over,

08:05.070 --> 08:06.130
Captain.

08:12.970 --> 08:13.800
I've decided.

08:13.800 --> 08:14.760
Huh?

08:15.890 --> 08:17.140
I am...

08:18.280 --> 08:21.670
I am going to marry you!

08:22.600 --> 08:23.480
<i>What?!</i>

08:23.480 --> 08:26.440
What?! The captain?!

08:26.680 --> 08:31.400
Y-You're suddenly bringing up marriage?!
I'm only ten years old!

08:31.400 --> 08:34.510
And I don't know anything about you!

08:34.880 --> 08:36.580
That's a good point.

08:37.790 --> 08:39.300
Then, I'll introduce myself.

08:39.300 --> 08:42.280
My name is Tijuana von Liebert.

08:42.680 --> 08:46.090
I am the captain of the 
Royal Chivalric Order of Esfort.

08:46.090 --> 08:48.230
I hold the title of honorary viscount.

08:48.230 --> 08:51.710
I am the daughter of Duke Liebert,
who oversees the northern forest.

08:51.710 --> 08:54.590
And you needn't worry
about the age difference!

08:54.590 --> 08:57.370
Since I'm an elf,
I'll live at least 300 years!

08:57.370 --> 09:00.170
That means my looks won't
be changing for a long time!

09:00.170 --> 09:01.680
That's not the issue...

09:02.410 --> 09:05.350
Despite how I may seem,
I'm quite confident in my looks.

09:06.020 --> 09:07.620
But still...

09:07.620 --> 09:10.450
I don't think a duke's daughter
can make decisions on her marriage

09:10.450 --> 09:11.920
at her own discretion!

09:11.920 --> 09:13.490
No need to worry about that!

09:13.490 --> 09:14.320
Huh?

09:14.320 --> 09:15.920
When I left home,

09:15.920 --> 09:20.540
I said I wouldn't return until I found
a marriage partner, so it'll be fine!

09:20.540 --> 09:23.040
It may be fine for you, but not for me!

09:23.040 --> 09:27.000
I have to consult with my father
and lots of other people!

09:27.000 --> 09:28.860
Vice Captain Daim!

09:30.330 --> 09:32.380
How are you asleep?!

09:32.640 --> 09:34.210
Yes, indeed...

09:34.210 --> 09:38.630
It's true that I can't make
the decision on my own.

09:38.630 --> 09:41.210
Thank you, Captain Tijuana!

09:41.210 --> 09:42.140
I'm glad you understand—

09:42.670 --> 09:43.420
Daim.

09:43.420 --> 09:44.130
Ma'am.

09:44.130 --> 09:46.370
I'll speak with the king first.

09:46.970 --> 09:49.440
Arrange an audience at once.

09:49.440 --> 09:51.980
Wait, that's the worst
thing that could happen!

09:52.490 --> 09:55.740
Letting the king hear about
this is the last thing I need!

09:56.090 --> 09:56.700
Daim.

09:56.700 --> 09:57.350
Ma'am.

09:57.350 --> 09:58.570
Bring him.

09:59.430 --> 10:02.370
N-No! I don't want this!

10:02.370 --> 10:07.960
Captain Tijuana! Anything but that!

10:16.630 --> 10:20.510
Cain, I was told you've come
here on urgent business,

10:20.880 --> 10:22.350
but why are you here?

10:22.760 --> 10:26.680
Didn't you go to the knights' station
to drop off some monster materials?

10:27.050 --> 10:30.400
Your Majesty! I have decided
that Baron Cain and I...

10:31.130 --> 10:33.360
will get married! Yes!

10:33.770 --> 10:35.130
Married?!

10:35.590 --> 10:37.110
How did that happen?!

10:37.110 --> 10:39.530
Cain, explain from the beginning!

10:40.200 --> 10:41.240
The truth is...

10:41.580 --> 10:45.120
I had a mock battle with her and won,

10:45.370 --> 10:46.830
and it led to this.

10:46.830 --> 10:51.290
Cain! Haven't you told her
about Teles and Miss Silk yet?!

10:51.510 --> 10:54.250
That matter was supposed to be confidential,

10:54.730 --> 10:55.710
so not yet.

10:55.710 --> 11:00.680
Cain, do you even realize the
position Captain Tijuana holds?

11:00.680 --> 11:03.600
No, only that she's the
captain of the knights.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.110
I thought so.

11:05.420 --> 11:08.170
The Liebert territory that she comes from

11:08.170 --> 11:10.690
was originally an elf nation.

11:11.300 --> 11:13.290
Elves are all beautiful, as you know.

11:13.730 --> 11:16.650
For that reason, they were often
dragged into wars by those

11:16.650 --> 11:19.440
who wanted to kidnap or enslave them.

11:20.080 --> 11:22.640
But here in the Kingdom of Esfort,

11:22.640 --> 11:26.410
per the dying wish of the first king,
Yuuya Terra Hirasawa Esfort,

11:26.410 --> 11:28.810
there is no discrimination based on race.

11:29.450 --> 11:34.880
That's why we took their land under our
protection as a territory of the kingdom.

11:35.400 --> 11:37.570
The Liebert territory is self-governed,

11:37.570 --> 11:39.990
and differs little from
an independent nation.

11:39.990 --> 11:44.080
In other words,
Tijuana is essentially a princess,

11:44.080 --> 11:46.720
and you've received a marriage
proposal from said princess.

11:47.000 --> 11:49.430
Do you understand what that means?

11:50.050 --> 11:55.540
Tijuana, this is still confidential,
but I'll inform you.

11:55.850 --> 12:01.180
Cain here is already engaged
to my daughter Telestia

12:01.180 --> 12:04.240
as well as Duke Eric's daughter, Miss Silk.

12:08.090 --> 12:10.680
So that means Baron Cain

12:11.050 --> 12:14.360
is extraordinary enough
to have been recognized

12:14.360 --> 12:16.540
by both Your Majesty and Duke Eric.

12:17.970 --> 12:19.110
I understand.

12:19.110 --> 12:21.920
I'm glad you understand, Tijuana.

12:22.460 --> 12:23.710
I am sorry, but—

12:23.710 --> 12:24.610
Well...

12:25.360 --> 12:30.240
That just makes me want to
marry Baron Cain all the more!

12:30.240 --> 12:32.520
The desire grows stronger... and stronger!

12:32.740 --> 12:34.730
Why is that what it leads to?

12:34.730 --> 12:38.350
All right. I acknowledge your feelings.

12:38.350 --> 12:42.530
But first, you need to write a
letter to your father, Laysan.

12:42.530 --> 12:44.720
We'll talk only after
you earn his permission.

12:44.720 --> 12:45.950
Understood!

12:45.950 --> 12:48.980
In that case, Your Majesty,
I'll take my leave now!

12:48.980 --> 12:50.730
Let's go, Cain!

12:50.730 --> 12:52.290
G-Go where?

12:52.570 --> 12:56.580
To the battle arena, to further deepen
our love and write that letter!

12:56.580 --> 12:57.130
Huh?

12:57.130 --> 12:59.590
And now, we'll be on our way!

13:01.230 --> 13:04.290
I can't believe he even defeated Tijuana.

13:04.910 --> 13:07.580
She's the kingdom's strongest knight!

13:07.580 --> 13:10.790
Perhaps the captain was under the weather?

13:10.790 --> 13:13.130
No, that's not the case at all.

13:13.130 --> 13:16.270
Yes, to be so strong at the age of ten...

13:16.820 --> 13:20.130
How in the world is he so powerful?

13:20.620 --> 13:24.190
Garm, he's your son. What is the story?

13:24.480 --> 13:26.480
I'm afraid I don't know, either.

13:26.480 --> 13:29.660
Apparently, he killed the red dragon
in his mansion by himself, too.

13:29.980 --> 13:31.260
Now that you mention it...

13:31.260 --> 13:36.590
When I asked him if he was a
hero or a disciple of the gods,

13:36.920 --> 13:38.710
he did react for a brief moment.

13:39.020 --> 13:41.790
So there really is something to him.

13:41.790 --> 13:43.840
There is a way to test him...

13:43.840 --> 13:45.420
By showing him <i>that</i>.

13:46.020 --> 13:46.680
"That"?

13:47.320 --> 13:48.390
Oh, that!

13:51.000 --> 13:52.310
Cain!

13:54.090 --> 13:55.270
Cain.

13:55.270 --> 13:58.630
Don't worry. It's just me today.

13:59.000 --> 14:00.720
Vice Captain Daim...

14:00.720 --> 14:02.500
You look exhausted.

14:02.500 --> 14:04.260
Can you blame me?

14:04.260 --> 14:07.820
I've had to go on "dates" with
her every single day since then.

14:08.290 --> 14:12.930
And Tijuana never lets me go until
my endurance has reached its limit.

14:13.930 --> 14:18.290
Your mock battles have reached a
level that none of us can even touch.

14:18.920 --> 14:22.790
But thanks to you, our captain
has gotten even stronger.

14:23.040 --> 14:26.260
Actually, while I was having
mock battles with Tijuana,

14:26.850 --> 14:30.550
the title of "Master Swordsperson"
was added to my status.

14:28.090 --> 14:30.550
<b>Master Swordsperson</b>

14:31.130 --> 14:34.390
Um... Has Tijuana always been like that?

14:34.390 --> 14:37.610
Yes, and she leaves all
the knight business to me.

14:37.610 --> 14:38.630
I figured.

14:38.630 --> 14:41.610
Cain! Where are you, Cain?

14:39.570 --> 14:41.610
Oh, crap!

14:43.860 --> 14:44.540
What?

14:44.540 --> 14:47.160
Let's hurry. His Majesty wants to see you.

14:46.380 --> 14:50.120
Wh-Why?! Did I do something again?!

14:48.850 --> 14:53.710
Cain! Let us show our love for one
another until our bodies give out!

14:50.120 --> 14:54.530
I've been really careful
not to make him angry!

14:56.920 --> 14:58.200
Um...

14:58.700 --> 15:01.290
Why are all of you here?

15:01.290 --> 15:04.750
Cain, why are you making that face?

15:04.750 --> 15:07.340
Oh... No reason.

15:07.340 --> 15:11.170
I've called you here today because
I want to show you something.

15:11.820 --> 15:12.550
Magna.

15:12.550 --> 15:14.680
Yes, sire. Look at this, Cain.

15:15.240 --> 15:18.140
This is an emperor-level magic text that
is passed down in the royal family.

15:18.140 --> 15:19.060
Huh?!

15:19.440 --> 15:24.230
It's said that the first king,
Yuuya Terra Hirasawa Esfort, wrote it.

15:24.540 --> 15:27.260
Wow... An emperor-level magic text!

15:27.260 --> 15:29.440
You mean I can look at this?

15:29.720 --> 15:31.230
Yes, you may.

15:31.230 --> 15:32.850
Thank you!

15:32.850 --> 15:37.180
Even the magic texts in the palace mages'
library only went up to mega-level!

15:39.200 --> 15:42.420
Stars' Judgment

15:39.850 --> 15:42.420
This is a spell I've never seen before!

15:42.850 --> 15:45.850
Wow! So there really is an even higher level!

15:48.160 --> 15:49.940
I thought so.

15:50.500 --> 15:51.630
What is it?

15:51.910 --> 15:54.590
Cain, that text...

15:55.240 --> 15:57.980
is one that none of us can read.

15:58.410 --> 15:59.810
Do you know why that is?

16:01.020 --> 16:02.480
Stars' Judgment

16:04.680 --> 16:05.950
That's right.

16:05.950 --> 16:09.130
Because it was written by our first king...

16:09.690 --> 16:12.620
in a language called "Japanese."

16:13.460 --> 16:14.710
<i>That's right.</i>

16:14.710 --> 16:17.990
<i>The first king's name was
Yuuya Terra Hirasawa.</i>

16:17.990 --> 16:20.630
<i>That's obviously a Japanese person's name.</i>

16:21.020 --> 16:23.920
<i>He was probably reincarnated, like me.</i>

16:24.320 --> 16:28.220
We know it's emperor-level magic
because it's handed down as such,

16:28.220 --> 16:30.550
but there's no one here who can read it.

16:30.550 --> 16:33.130
Cain, I ask you once more...

16:34.010 --> 16:35.800
Just who are you?

16:38.210 --> 16:39.860
<i>I can't hide it anymore.</i>

16:40.170 --> 16:44.630
<i>When they find out I was reincarnated,
will I lose everything?</i>

16:45.200 --> 16:48.960
<i>No... But surely these people would...</i>

16:52.820 --> 16:54.610
I'll tell you the truth,

16:54.610 --> 16:59.460
but can you promise that only those
present right now will ever know?

16:59.870 --> 17:02.290
If you can't understand,

17:02.830 --> 17:06.420
I'll have to leave this kingdom.

17:07.950 --> 17:09.070
Very well.

17:10.090 --> 17:13.130
I have my memories from my previous life.

17:14.470 --> 17:18.550
Memories of a different land,
the one your first king came from...

17:18.790 --> 17:21.890
Memories of a nation called Japan.

17:21.890 --> 17:22.830
Wha—

17:22.830 --> 17:23.980
Cain...

17:23.980 --> 17:26.470
I'm sorry I never told you.

17:26.980 --> 17:28.840
So that's why...

17:29.150 --> 17:33.690
Cain, are you truly Sarah's and my son?

17:34.020 --> 17:36.860
Yes, there's no doubt about that.

17:36.860 --> 17:41.530
The gods told me so when 
I was baptized at age five.

17:41.530 --> 17:44.670
Y-You met the gods?!

17:44.670 --> 17:45.540
Yes.

17:45.780 --> 17:48.820
At my baptism, and when I go to church.

17:48.820 --> 17:51.250
I meet with the seven gods often.

17:52.000 --> 17:54.210
What?! All seven of them?!

17:54.210 --> 17:55.020
Yes.

17:55.020 --> 17:58.180
Cain, would you show us your status?

17:58.980 --> 18:01.100
Status Open.

18:02.240 --> 18:06.060
Cain! Is what's written here true?!

18:06.330 --> 18:08.710
Yes, it's completely true.

18:07.790 --> 18:10.270
<b>The Reincarnated
God's Chosen</b>

18:08.290 --> 18:10.270
<b>Protection of the God of Creation     10
Protection of the God of Magic         10
Protection of the God of War            10
Protection of the God of Commerce 10</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:11.230
These are my real titles.

18:09.420 --> 18:10.270
<b>Protection of the God of Life              10
Protection of the God of Earth           10
Protection of the God of Technology 10</b>

18:13.130 --> 18:15.490
Whatever are we going to do with you?

18:16.170 --> 18:18.970
Why didn't you tell us the truth?

18:18.970 --> 18:21.700
With that title, in addition to myself...

18:22.260 --> 18:28.010
Every single citizen of this kingdom—
no, of this world—must bow to you!

18:28.540 --> 18:31.750
That's just how high the
title of God's Chosen is!

18:31.980 --> 18:34.760
Wait a minute! That's not what I want!

18:34.760 --> 18:38.230
It's true that I have my
memories of my previous life,

18:38.230 --> 18:40.930
but I'm content with the life I have now!

18:40.930 --> 18:44.680
I understood nothing when 
I reincarnated in this world,

18:44.680 --> 18:49.480
but my mother, father, and many
other people were kind to me.

18:50.020 --> 18:54.020
The experiences I've had using magic
and fighting monsters on my adventures

18:54.020 --> 18:55.690
were so exciting.

18:55.690 --> 18:59.490
Meeting Teles, Silk, and all of you,

18:59.980 --> 19:04.650
and being named a baron, 
an honor far greater than I deserve...

19:05.790 --> 19:09.500
In my previous world, I had lost
my parents and grandfather,

19:09.980 --> 19:11.440
and I was all alone.

19:11.770 --> 19:15.800
But now, I'm blessed with a wonderful
circle of family and friends,

19:15.800 --> 19:17.510
and I live a happy life!

19:17.730 --> 19:23.220
Father, I am truly grateful
that I became a son of Garm!

19:23.640 --> 19:24.680
Cain...

19:24.680 --> 19:28.300
Your Majesty, I apologize for
hiding all this from you,

19:28.660 --> 19:33.150
but could I ask you to please treat
me the same way you always have?

19:33.440 --> 19:35.610
Your Majesty, I...

19:36.100 --> 19:37.300
Very well.

19:38.090 --> 19:42.650
Cain, this kingdom recognizes
you as Garm's son,

19:42.650 --> 19:45.620
Baron Cain von Silford,
just as it has up until now.

19:45.850 --> 19:47.580
However, Cain...

19:48.010 --> 19:51.040
Maybe you should be the king instead?

19:52.200 --> 19:53.320
Your Majesty!

19:53.320 --> 19:54.080
H-Hey!

19:54.080 --> 19:55.420
My dear husband!

19:57.580 --> 19:59.590
I found you, my dear husband!

19:59.890 --> 20:03.510
Your Majesty, I just received
this from my father!

20:03.880 --> 20:07.680
He has granted me permission
 to marry Baron Cain!

20:09.990 --> 20:11.980
Congratulations!

20:12.390 --> 20:15.040
Well, Your Majesty, 
I'm in a hurry, so I'll be off!

20:15.040 --> 20:17.110
My dear husband!

20:17.520 --> 20:20.270
She took him away again today...

20:21.960 --> 20:23.180
Your Majesty...

20:23.180 --> 20:28.200
The way Cain was acting just now,
I don't think you need to worry.

20:28.850 --> 20:31.800
Cain will always just be Cain.

20:33.510 --> 20:34.920
You're right.

20:35.270 --> 20:37.850
He certainly doesn't look
like a divine child.

20:38.780 --> 20:41.450
No one is permitted to speak of
this matter outside this chamber.

20:42.210 --> 20:44.450
You must tell no one, not even your families.

20:44.450 --> 20:46.290
Understand?

20:46.290 --> 20:46.840
Yes, sire!

20:47.670 --> 20:48.550
<i>Cain...</i>

20:49.250 --> 20:51.740
<i>Just look at how strong you are.</i>

20:52.120 --> 20:56.050
<i>Please protect this country, your family,</i>

20:56.900 --> 20:58.470
<i>Teles and Silk,</i>

20:59.440 --> 21:02.780
<i>and all the citizens who seek your aid.</i>

21:03.980 --> 21:05.360
<i>Cain!</i>

22:41.530 --> 22:42.710
Master Cain!

22:42.710 --> 22:44.170
Cain!

22:44.170 --> 22:48.630
How did you end up engaged
to Captain Tijuana?!

22:49.070 --> 22:50.280
I'm sorry.

22:50.280 --> 22:54.350
I fought a mock battle with the 
Chivalric Order, and that's how it ended.

22:56.290 --> 22:59.710
How many fiancées will you have
by the time you reach adulthood?

23:00.310 --> 23:03.400
Though I'm having fun, so I don't mind.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.820
Well, I mind!

23:04.820 --> 23:08.250
Please stop indiscriminately
accepting more fiancées!

23:08.970 --> 23:11.470
My dear husband! There you are!

23:11.470 --> 23:13.530
Let's share our love lots
and lots again today!

23:13.530 --> 23:16.170
What does "share our love" mean?!

23:16.170 --> 23:17.510
Cain!

23:16.170 --> 23:17.510
Master Cain!

23:17.510 --> 23:20.780
I-It's not like that!
Hear me out, Teles, Silk!

23:20.780 --> 23:23.390
She just means we'll have
another mock battle!

23:23.390 --> 23:27.500
No! You'll get me in trouble again!

23:24.530 --> 23:27.500
My dear husband, I won't let you go today!

23:27.500 --> 23:29.370
Master Cain!

23:27.500 --> 23:29.370
Cain!

23:29.370 --> 23:33.370
Help me!

23:31.950 --> 23:33.620
Not until morning!

23:34.990 --> 23:36.470
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.480 --> 23:36.180
My dear husband!

23:36.180 --> 23:37.330
Wait a second!

23:36.870 --> 23:40.250
<b>"Cain, the Rookie Adventurer"</b>

23:37.330 --> 23:39.550
Next time, "Cain, the Rookie Adventurer"!
